  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cultural soir&#xe9;e : Voices for Life, an initiative for the 16 Days of Activism against Gender-Based Violence - The Center for Artistic Recreation Association (ACRA) initiative for the 16 Days of Activism Against Gender Based Violence aims to raise public awareness about the urgency of speaking out against femicide in Mozambique by using art and culture as instruments of mobilization and reflection. The event will provide a safe and creative space for expression and dialogue, complementing traditional advocacy approaches and promoting a deeper &#xa0;engagement against GBV.</narrative>
  </description>
